OL,3,GNEWSAChoir call-out: 'Do you have a
OL,4,Asinging son?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FChoral singing has been a part of
OL,7,Ftradition in Winchester for centuries -
OL,8,Fand with their red coats and high
OL,9,Fnotes, the Pilgrims' School's
OL,10,FChoristers and Quiristers are keeping
OL,11,Fit alive.
OL,13,FThe search for the next generation of
OL,14,Fboys to have a "life-changing singing
OL,15,Fopportunity" is underway.
OL,17,FWinchester College, Winchester
OL,18,FCathedral and The Pilgrims' School are
OL,19,Fjoining forces to launch their Be a
OL,20,FChorister Day.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
