OL,5,
OL,6,FThe event on Saturday is designed to
OL,7,Fgive boys ages six to 10 a chance to
OL,8,Fexperience the chorister lifestyle for
OL,9,Fan afternoon, to potentially join other
OL,10,Fchildren on choral scholarships.
